      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/1"/>(Adonoy’s) people, be strong; let us be strong
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/2"/>and call strongly to Adonoy.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/3"/>The iniquitous will confess his sin,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/4"/>and return to Adonoy who will pity him.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/5"/>Call to Him who neither sleeps nor slumbers,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/6"/>Guardian of Israel,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/7"/>“Wake up! Why’re you sleeping?
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/8"/>Recall uprightness and deeds well done!”
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/9"/>And Adonoy will do what He thinks best.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/10"/>God of truth, assured us,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/11"/>“I do not desire a person’s death.”
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/12"/>Now that He’s available, seek Him out;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/13"/>call to Him when He is near.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/14"/>Appease Him, beg Him, serve Him in awe;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/15"/>all Jacob’s seed, honor Him!
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/16"/>Persist at the doors of the patient One,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/17"/>lift our hearts as high as our hands.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/18"/>Whoever can appease [Him] effectively—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/19"/>prepare [to pray] to your God, O Israel.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/20"/>Arrange tearful prayers
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/21"/>because of Your tribulation;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/22"/>designate a fast; call a [prayer] meeting.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/23"/>Let God’s servant beg, pray
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/24"/>that He turn from His wrath
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/25"/>lest we be lost.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/26"/>Perhaps He will prefer those gifts
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/27"/>to fattened [animals]
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/28"/>and myriad streams of oil.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/29"/>Prefer [our] heeding to burnt offerings,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/30"/>obeying to the fat of rams.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/31"/>Refine and straighten the crooked—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/32"/>recall these [to the seed] of Jacob.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/33"/>Bring words with you,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:am_adonai_chizqu_venitchazzeqah/34"/>and let us make up for bullocks with our lips.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
